EPENDS_ON with no meta, and no repo entity is upserted. [files: src/indexer/resolver.ts, src/indexer/parser/typescript.ts, src/indexer/index.ts]","action":"none","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"current-behaviour.4","ref":"current-behaviour","item":"current-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Pass 2 today resolves only INHERITS/IMPLEMENTS/CALLS, a call only into files reachable by stored IMPORTS edges, and writes meta only for ambiguous rows (via updateUnresolvedMetaBatch, which REPLACES meta)","evidence":"cross-file-resolver.ts:306-313 handles only INHERITS/IMPLEMENTS/CALLS and skips other kinds; :488-498 importedFiles from prefetchImportsByFile, then `if (!importedFiles.has(e.file)) continue`; :343 updateUnresolvedMetaBatch(ambiguousUpdates). relations.ts:453 `{ ...row, meta, attemptedAt }`, a replace. The callers build `{ ...row.meta, candidates }` (:433, :454, :484, :504), as the LLD states. [files: src/indexer/cross-file-resolver.ts, src/db/relations.ts]","action":"none","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"new-versus-reuse.1","ref":"new-versus-reuse","item":"new-versus-reuse","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Reused: deleteEntitiesForRepo already removes vectors, doc summaries and the exploration cache, and every entity delete goes through detachDeleteEntitiesInTxn (the place export_names upkeep is added)","evidence":"entities.ts:560-583 calls detachDeleteEntities, deleteEntityVecsForRepo, deleteDocSummariesForRepo and deleteCachedExplorationsForRepo. detachDeleteEntities :1087 `withWriteTxn(s => detachDeleteEntitiesInTxn(s, u64s))`; reindexFile :485 calls detachDeleteEntitiesInTxn; deleteEntitiesById :557 and deleteEntitiesForFile :525 go through detachDeleteEntities. The InTxn body at :1099-1135 sweeps both directions and then removes the id maps, so adding the export_names removal before :1130 is feasible. [files: src/db/entities.ts]","action":"none","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"